silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_07_yoneda_profile_drill_sections_05_profunctor_generalization_concrete_anchor__heterolegprofunctor_d_mittens a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "HeteroLegProfunctor_D_Mittens: the heterogeneous profunctor that sends each pair (TaxonomyCategory_source, D_Mittens_object) to a set of typed arrows; e.g., (ITIS_category, D_Mittens_classification) -> the set of typing arrows from ITIS taxon rows to classification nodes; enables FelisCatusTSN183798 from a separate ITIS category to be a profunctorial source for the classification leg" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_07_yoneda_profile_drill_sections_05_profunctor_generalization_concrete_anchor__weightedcolimit_mittens a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "WeightedColimit_Mittens: MittensColimitApex expressed as the W-weighted colimit of D_Mittens; where W = the hom-profunctor restricted to the twelve source objects; this is the most general statement of the Mittens colimit construction" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_07_yoneda_profile_drill_sections_05_profunctor_generalization_concrete_anchor__sousobservation_profunctorial a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "SousObservation_Profunctorial: the sous reading position formalized as a profunctor map; the sous reads Hom(D_Mittens_source, Mittens) from outside the diagram category, without being a functor into D_Mittens; the profunctor framework makes this precise" .
